WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,480
Three snakes can be used to upgrade the fragments and then make props and exchange them.

2
00:00:03,040 --> 00:00:11,220
The Fifty Shades Below Zero set is absolutely true and false.

3
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:14,660
I'm wearing a green fur vest and practicing boxing outdoors right now, and it's not cold at all.

4
00:00:14,780 --> 00:00:16,620
So what are you waiting for? Go grab it now.

5
00:00:16,620 --> 00:00:17,580
It'll be gone if it's too late

6
00:00:17,820 --> 00:00:21,680
I'm so angry

7
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:23,240
Poisonous Gu Qiu worships you, you villain.

8
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:25,470
Why is it too warm?

9
00:00:25,470 --> 00:00:27,270
I feel like I can sleep outside the cold wave now

10
00:00:27,270 --> 00:00:28,750
The marshmallow fool upstairs

11
00:00:28,950 --> 00:00:30,830
Just keep your sister-in-law Ya Rong to wear it herself.

12
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:34,460
The effect of green fur suit

13
00:00:34,580 --> 00:00:35,780
Better than I expected

14
00:00:36,260 --> 00:00:37,420
just a few hours

15
00:00:37,700 --> 00:00:39,460
I have collected more than thirty fragment cards.

16
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:43,600
It’s actually a gold supply box

17
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:45,900
If you can't see it, you can find a subtle lure item inside.
